  m_text: 'HOW TO PLAY



    Explore the dungeon, defeat every enemy, and reach

    the
    exit to unlock the next level.



    MOVE          A / D  or  Arrow Keys

    JUMP         
    Space

    ATTACK        Left Mouse

    DASH          Left Shift

    HEAVY
    STRIKE  Right Mouse

    INTERACT      E

    DRINK POTION  Q

    PAUSE        
    Escape



    On mobile, use the on-screen buttons.



    TIPS

    Dash and
    Heavy Strike cost stamina - watch the bar.

    Open chests for potions. Some
    doors need a key or

    a switch. Coins are your leaderboard score.'
